  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01468",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "这时候，我的头脑清晰极了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At that moment, my mind was extraordinarily clear.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01468",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "火柴为数有限。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There were only a limited number of matches.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01468",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "这回我走到了另一个角落，珍惜地划了一根火柴，把另一捆稻草点燃了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This time I walked to another corner, carefully struck a match, and set another bundle of straw alight.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01468",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "熊熊的烈火安慰了我。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The blazing fire comforted me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01468",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "以前我和朋友烧天火的时候，我是特别擅长点火的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In the past, when I made bonfires with my friends, I was especially good at lighting them.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
